  "notes": "Started from the CockroachDB routine form (same field ids); providers/yugabytedb/routines.py. A routine resource is named name(argument types); parameters come from pg_get_function_arguments (names, modes, defaults) and RETURNS TABLE columns from pg_get_function_result. Round trip verified live on YugabyteDB 2025.2.2.2 by tools/tests/test_ui_descriptor_roundtrip_yugabytedb.py (2026-10-30)."
